vp torquesLeft 500 -50 50
vpd torquesLeft representation:JointSensorData:torque:lHipPitch blue
vpd torquesLeft representation:JointSensorData:torque:lHipRoll green
vpd torquesLeft representation:JointSensorData:torque:lHipYaw cyan
vpd torquesLeft representation:JointSensorData:torque:lKneePitch orange
vpd torquesLeft representation:JointSensorData:torque:lAnklePitch red
vpd torquesLeft representation:JointSensorData:torque:lAnkleRoll magenta
vp torquesRight 500 -50 50
vpd torquesRight representation:JointSensorData:torque:rHipPitch blue
vpd torquesRight representation:JointSensorData:torque:rHipRoll green
vpd torquesRight representation:JointSensorData:torque:rHipYaw cyan
vpd torquesRight representation:JointSensorData:torque:rKneePitch orange
vpd torquesRight representation:JointSensorData:torque:rAnklePitch red
vpd torquesRight representation:JointSensorData:torque:rAnkleRoll magenta
